        <h2>扫描结果</h2>
        <table>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td><strong>上次扫描</strong></td><td>{h(discovered_at or "尚未扫描")}</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>摘要</strong></td><td><pre class="raw-health">{h(discovery_raw or "当前没有扫描输出。")}</pre></td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </section>

      <section class="section" data-section="assets">
        <h2>正式资产</h2>
        <p>这里按资产用途分区，左侧菜单不拆层级，页面内部再看分类。</p>
        {render_asset_filters(agent_registry)}
        {render_asset_sections(agent_registry)}
        <div class="empty">没有匹配的资产。</div>
